[139.385968, "o", "11:## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing\r\n28:## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing — field notes\r\n252:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence\r\n262:## Investigation Brief 02 — Status Precedence — field notes\r\n468:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing\r\n479:## Investigation Brief 03 — Compliance Mail Timing — field notes\r\n685:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence\r\n696:## Investigation Brief 04 — Correction Notice Precedence — field notes\r\n828:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners\r\n838:## Investigation Brief 05 — Meeting Amendments and Owners — field notes\r\n1058:## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output\r\n1069:## Investigation Brief 06 — Effective Dates on Output — field notes\r\n1201:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n1213:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I) — field notes\r\n1419:## Investigation Brief 08 — Exception Flags (Part II) and Artifacts\r\n1440:## In"]
