[140.768391, "o", "ving after batch lock.\r\n  1833\t\r\n  1834\t## Meeting Notes\r\n  1835\t\r\n  1836\tCommittee minutes include signed amendments affecting owner fields.\r\n  1837\t\r\n  1838\t#### Amendment for TXN-cf3bbd14-d495-5867-b6e2-1d1633f87f15\r\n  1839\towner: asmith\r\n  1840\tsigned: true\r\n  1841\teffective: 2024-02-01\r\n  1842\t\r\n  1843\t#### Amendment for TXN-a4dc6038-0c06-5338-9a45-fccff83a6194\r\n  1844\towner: bwong\r\n  1845\tsigned: false\r\n  1846\t\r\n  1847\t#### Amendment for TXN-caf3e53e-08b7-5f87-a4bc-3cc0e10ff87f\r\n  1848\towner: evans\r\n  1849\tsigned: true\r\n  1850\teffective: 2024-11-01\r\n  1851\t\r\n  1852\t#### Amendment for TXN-ba9e6ade-67ce-5a61-b097-ab0d34f8e6bb\r\n  1853\towner: earlybird\r\n  1854\tsigned: true\r\n  1855\teffective: 2020-01-01\r\n  1856\t\r\n  1857\t## Email Excerpts\r\n  1858\t\r\n  1859\tInvestigator commentary: only compliance-addressed threads with transaction subjects in this section affect merge logic; surrounding mail establishes timing context.\r\n  1860\t\r\n  1861\tFrom: audit-lead@corp.internal\r\n  1862\tSubject: FY24 sampling plan draft "]
