[386.679422, "o", "  1201\t## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)\r\n"]
[386.679468, "o", "  1202\t\r\n"]
[386.679486, "o", "  1203\tExtract policy (authoritative):\r\n"]
[386.6795, "o", "  1204\t\r\n"]
[386.679515, "o", "  1205\tException coding review: `exception_reason` is null unless a code applies. Set\r\n"]
[386.679531, "o", "  1206\t`over_limit` when `amount_usd` strictly exceeds 10000. Set `compliance_hold`\r\n"]
[386.679545, "o", "  1207\twhen final status is `rejected`, a qualifying `compliance@` email referenced\r\n"]
[386.67956, "o", "  1208\tthat transaction, and that email block includes a `sent:` line. The sent-date\r\n"]
[386.679574, "o", "  1209\tcomparison used for `compliance_hold` is defined in Investigation Brief 09\r\n"]
[386.679589, "o", "  1210\t(Mid-Year Amendment), not Brief 03. Multiple reasons join with semicolon in\r\n"]
[386.680093, "o", "  1211\tlexical order of the reason codes.\r\n"]
