[551.931354, "o", "sment WP-3264 ties year-end close checklist drift to control deficiencies around mail ingestion. Teams must not treat decoy ledger headings or appendix commentary as authoritative transaction sources.\r\n  1364\t\r\n  1365\tMemo WP-4783 summarizes stakeholder interviews about year-end close checklist drift. Participants disagreed on whether unsigned amendments should ever override ledger owners; Brief 05 resolves that question for the extractor.\r\n  1366\t\r\n  1367\tDraft guidance in this paragraph is non-binding: some early tooling compared compliance mail against post-correction effective dates when flagging holds. The mid-year amendment later in this archive supersedes that draft practice.\r\n  1368\t\r\n  1369\tDuring December freeze, S. Patel circulated a draft finding on year-end close checklist drift. Finance operations pushed back, arguing the issue was transient cache state; QA reproduced the drift on a cold run the next morning.\r\n  1370\t\r\n  1371\tMemo WP-2571 summarizes stakeholder interviews about year-end close ch"]
[551.931361, "o", "ecklist drift. Participants disagreed on whether unsigned amendments should ever override ledger owners; Brief 05 resolves that question for the extractor.\r\n  1372\t\r\n  1373\tMemo WP-1476 summarizes stakeholder interviews about year-end close checklist drift. Participants disagreed on whether unsigned amendments should ever override ledger owners; Brief 05 resolves that question for the extractor.\r\n  1374\t\r\n  1375\tFollow-up #830 confirmed that controller had been using an informal spreadsheet for year-end close checklist drift. The formal extractor must instead derive rows only from the canonical ledger and structured sections at file end.\r\n  1376\t\r\n  1377\tDuring December freeze, J. Huang circulated a draft finding on year-end close checklist drift. Finance operations pushed back, arguing the issue was transient cache state; QA reproduced the drift on a cold run the next morning.\r\n  1378\t\r\n  1379\tInterview #272 with controller highlighted how year-end close checklist drift statements were forwarded without the"]
